 <italic>p</italic><sub>gs</sub> from a simulation study on <inline-formula id="IEq214"><!-- Alternate image not processed: 122_2009_1047_Article_IEq214.gif --><tex-math id="M143">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}\usepackage{amsmath}\usepackage{wasysym} \usepackage{amsfonts} \usepackage{amssymb} \usepackage{amsbsy}\usepackage{mathrsfs}\usepackage{upgreek}\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}\begin{document}$$ D_{{\bar{L}}}^{\rm mod} $$\end{document}</tex-math></inline-formula> for a range of values of genetic similarity <italic>p</italic><sub>gs</sub> and expected numbers of fragments <italic>m</italic><sub>1</sub> and <italic>m</italic><sub>2,</sub> 10,000 replicated pairs of AFLP profiles, 1,000 bootstrap resamples, <italic>fld</italic><italic>F</italic><sub>S</sub> from <italic>A. thaliana</italic> with <italic>N</italic>&#x000a0;=&#x000a0;450</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="2" colspan="3">Parameter settings</th><th align="left" colspan="6">Results for <inline-formula id="IEq215"><!-- Alternate image not processed: 122_2009_1047_Article_IEq215.gif --><tex-math id="M144">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}\usepackage{amsmath}\usepackage{wasysym} \usepackage{amsfonts} \usepackage{amssymb} \usepackage{amsbsy}\usepackage{mathrsfs}\usepackage{upgreek}\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}\begin{document}$$ D_{{\bar{L}}}^{\rm mod} $$\end{document}</tex-math></inline-formula>: 95% bootstrap confidence intervals for <italic>p</italic><sub>gs</sub></th></tr><tr><th align="left" colspan="2">Percentile bootstrap c.i.</th><th align="left" colspan="2">Bias corrected bootstrap c.i.</th><th align="left" colspan="2">BC<sub><italic>a</italic></sub> c.i.</th></tr><tr><th align="left"><italic>p</italic><sub>gs</sub></th><th align="left"><italic>m</italic><sub>1</sub>,</th><th align="left"><italic>m</italic><sub>2</sub></th><th align="left">Non-coverage% (too low, too high)</th><th align="left">Length (trunc)</th><th align="left">Non-coverage% (to