k}\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}\begin{document}$$ D_{L}^{\rm mod} $$\end{document}</tex-math></inline-formula> for a range of values of genetic similarity <italic>p</italic><sub>gs</sub> and expected numbers of fragments <italic>m</italic><sub>1</sub> and <italic>m</italic><sub>2,</sub> 10,000 replicated pairs of AFLP profiles, 1,000 bootstrap resamples, <italic>fld</italic><italic>F</italic><sub><italic>S</italic></sub> from <italic>A. thaliana</italic> with <italic>N</italic>&#x000a0;=&#x000a0;450</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="2" colspan="3">Parameter settings</th><th align="left" colspan="6">Results for <inline-formula id="IEq217"><!-- Alternate image not processed: 122_2009_1047_Article_IEq217.gif --><tex-math id="M146">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}\usepackage{amsmath}\usepackage{wasysym} \usepackage{amsfonts} \usepackage{amssymb} \usepackage{amsbsy}\usepackage{mathrsfs}\usepackage{upgreek}\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}\begin{document}$$ D_{L}^{\rm mod} $$\end{document}</tex-math></inline-formula>: 95% bootstrap confidence intervals for <italic>p</italic><sub>gs</sub></th></tr><tr><th align="left" colspan="2">Percentile bootstrap c.i.</th><th align="left" colspan="2">Bias corrected bootstrap c.i.</th><th align="left" colspan="2"><italic>BC</italic><sub><italic>a</italic></sub> c.i.</th></tr><tr><th align="left"><italic>p</italic><sub>gs</sub></th><th align="left"><italic>m</italic><sub>1</sub>,</th><th align="left"><italic>m</italic><sub>2</sub></th><th align="left">Non-coverage (too low, too high)</th><th align="left">Length (trunc)</th><th align="left">Non-coverage (too low, too high)</th><th align="left">Length (trunc)</th><th align="left">Non-coverage (too low, too high)</th><th align="left">Length (trunc)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left"/><td char="." align="char">40</td><td char="." align="char">40</td><td char="(" align="char">6.76 (5.22, 1.54)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2527 (0.1339)</td><td char="(" align="char">6.35 (4.58, 1.77)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2544 (0.1394)</td><td char="(" align="char">5.55 (3.15, 2.40)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2605 (0.1524)</td></tr><tr><td align="left"/><td char="." align="char">70</td><td char="." align="char">70</td><td char="(" align="char">5.36 (3.30, 2.06)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2718 (0.1354)</td><td char="(" align="char">5.33 (3.12, 2.21)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2720 (0.1369)</td><td char="(" align="char">5.17 (2.68, 2.49)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2725 (0.1409)</td></tr><tr><td align="left"/><td char="." align="char">120</td><td char="." align="char">120</td><td char="(" align="char">5.39 (2.88, 2.51)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2943 (0.1419)</td><td char="(" align="char">5.60 (3.06, 2.54)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2944 (0.1413)</td><td char="(" align="char">5.55 (2.99, 2.56)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2944 (0.1419)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">0.1</td><td char="." align="char">40</td><td char="." align="char">40</td><td char="(" align="char">5.80 (4.18, 1.62)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2913 (0.2378)</td><td char="(" align="char">5.44 (3.59, 1.85)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2922 (0.2419)</td><td char="(" align="char">4.52 (2.28, 2.24)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2957 (0.2510)</td></tr><tr><td align="left"/><td char="." align="char">70</td><td char="." align="char">70</td><td char="(" align="char">5.35 (3.12, 2.23)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2812 (0.2273)</td><td char="(" align="char">5.21 (2.88, 2.33)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2812 (0.2285)</td><td char="(" align="char">5.05 (2.50, 2.55)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2815 (0.2311)</td></tr><tr><td align="left"/><td char="." align="char">120</td><td char="." align="char">120</td><td char="(" align="char">5.21 (2.87, 2.34)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2860 (0.2252)</td><td char="(" align="char">5.22 (2.97, 2.25)</td><td char="." align="char">0.2861 (0.2247)</td><td ch